{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/273725-player-lfg-vtr-b-s","id":273725,"title":"Player LFG, VtR:B&S","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-06T06:37:19-07:00","id":273725,"title":"Player LFG, VtR:B&S","content":"HI,<br /> <br /> I'm looking for a group or 1 on 1 ST for Vampire: the Requiem using the new Blood and Smoke, Strix chronicles update (some keywords for googlers there <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. I was thinking mainly about PBP/PBEM or other async way to play, but IRC or some other chat might be workable given compatible schedules. My timezone is +2.<br /> <br /> Mild crosssplats are ok, but I'm thinking about mostly vampires so no kitchen sink approach, please. Starting as mortal or even a hunter is ok. Adult themes are also ok, but I don't want it to be a focus (e.g. PC might find a mutilated corpse or get into bed with someone, but no need to RP it in detail).<br /> <br /> If I missed some relevant info, don't hesitate to ask!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4014-hukka","name":"hukka","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T16:00:48-07:00","id":274231,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Can you tell me (us) more about the setting for this campaign? Oh! And are there any house rules I (we) should know about?</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 10-06-2014, 07:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T09:16:41-07:00","id":274773,"title":"","content":"Sorry, I guess I wasn't clear that I don't feel experienced enough to run a game, so I'm looking for a storyteller or a group that already has one. I'm not too picky on the setting, as players often can't be with as few potential STs as there usually are <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <br /> Or in case you *are* asking me as a player, then I suppose I could join in brainstorming for a setting. In fact I have been gathering plans for running something set in high latitudes later over a real table, after I'm more used to the rules. The only house rule, or perhaps clarification I've been thinking about is how to handle artificial light as damage source (all bright lights, UV, nuclear reactors or no artificial sources at all?) and whether going deep enough in the ground would prevent the daysleep.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4014-hukka","name":"hukka","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T09:28:15-07:00","id":274795,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Ah, my mistake. I was under the impression that you were a storyteller of some sort. Anyway, thank you for answering my questions on such short notice. Please let me know if anyone does offer to host a game of Vampire the Requiem 2nd edition; I'd be happy to play too.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 10-07-2014, 12:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}